      "rev_n_2_f98827_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_2_f98827_1",
        "node_id": "n_2_f98827",
        "thought_text": "Instead of looking for patterns in adjacent elements, consider the impact of each operation on the overall sequence value. Evaluate the potential gain or loss from each possible operation and choose the one that maximizes the final element's value. This approach will ensure that we consider all possible sequences and their resulting values, leading to the optimal solution.",
