        "node_id": "n_3_b3b46b",
        "thought_text": "The current approach doesn't consider all possible cases and doesn't guarantee maximizing the final element. A better approach would be to use dynamic programming to calculate the maximum possible value at each position, considering all possible operations. This would allow us to make optimal choices at each step to maximize the final element.",
